1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,700
 In the next 60 seconds, I'm going to show you how to see everything your competition is up to.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,040
 Go to Google and type in Facebook ads library.

3
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:09,260
 Just select the country that you care about and then select all ads.

4
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,340
 And just type in the company that you want to spy on.

5
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:13,540
 And there you can see all of the ads.

6
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:17,240
 We can use this to figure out what worked for them previously and what didn't.

7
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:23,980
 And if you deactivate the active filter, then you can see all the ads that they have run in the past as well.

8
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,160
 I've got one more for you.

9
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,380
 Search on Google for Google ads transparency.

10
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,660
 And then it should be the first link.

11
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,340
 And then just type in the company that you want to spy on.

12
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:36,660
 Here again, we can see all the ads that this company is running.

13
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:37,640
 Have fun.

